# Acca

Build **one acca** from picks that would each stand alone as singles.

- Leg count and combined odds range come from the UI / user request — not hard-coded
- Every leg must pass the same confidence gate as a single
- All markets allowed when evidenced
- Populate `suggested_tickets` with leg indices (web app)

Save suffix (chat): `_acca-today.md` or `_acca-tomorrow.md`.
